#: ../../openmvcam/shields/light-shield.rst:41
msgid ""
"The shield draws LED power straight from the camera's VIN pin. USB does not "
"feed VIN on any OpenMV Cam, so VIN must be supplied externally (battery, "
"bench supply, or similar) — pick a source rated for the combined current "
"draw of all nine LEDs at full brightness."
msgstr ""
"擴充板直接從相機的 VIN 接腳取得 LED 電力。任何 OpenMV Cam 上的 USB 皆不會為 VIN 供電，因此 VIN "
"必須由外部供應（電池、實驗室電源供應器或類似來源）— 請選擇額定電流足以承受全部九顆 LED 在全亮度下合計電流的電源。"

